      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Test payloads for RdfStreamingOutputTest#testJsonLdExpanded, RdfStreamingOutputTest#testJsonLdFlattened and RdfStreamingOutputTest#testJsonLdCompacted were taken from the JSON-LD specification and use real names and URLs for spec authors. It would be good to remove these and replace them with generic identifiers and URLs.</p>",
