  "description": "<p>Upgrading to Apache Jena 5.4.0 means a change to the underlying Json-LD library. It becomes titanium-json-ld. There is not currently a way to produce Json-ld compacted, expanded or flattened just with Jena, it requires using titanium directly. This needs to be fixed to allow for feature parity with Fedora 6.5.0</p>",
